  a cinder_build structure with version and compiler information.:ü
libc_ver*éPlatform-specific queries ‚Äî @none on a platform other than the one they
describe, or when the underlying intrinsic fails; the caller uses if let.
Gets C library version information (Unix-only).
Returns:
  some(libc_version) on Unix systems, none otherwise or on error.:ì
	win32_ver*ÅGets Windows version information (Windows-only).
